Body:
It is Disabled by default as of now.
In order to toggle it on you need to make `~/.config/opencode/tui.json` (`~` means your user folder if you don't know `C:\Users\[USERNAME]`)
And put in a keybind for toggling it on:
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/tui.json",
  "keybinds": {
    "scrollbar_toggle": "ctrl+alt+s"
  }
}
```
Open OpenCode in the Terminal and use the keybind. It will be toggled on until you toggle it back off (Meaning it will stay there even if you open a new instance).
